// The oil press: at a workbench 3 fungus press into 2 measures of fungus oil (the pack, on the go, takes 2
// a measure), and 2 mushrooms from a farm press into 1. Away from a bench nothing is pressed.
map
BBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBB
#......................................#
#......................................#
#......................................#
#......................................#
#......................................#
#......................................#
#......................................#
#......................................#
#......................................#
#..................@...................#
########################################
end
mode survival
give Fungus 7
give Mushroom 2
give Stone 4
craft 3 Fungus_oil_x2
expect 4 inv:FungusOil == 2            // the kit's 2: no bench yet
station 5 2 0 Workbench
craft 7 Fungus_oil_x2
expect 8 inv:FungusOil == 4
expect 8 inv:Fungus == 4
craft 9 Fungus_oil_(mushroom)
expect 10 inv:FungusOil == 5
expect 10 inv:Mushroom == 0
craft 11 Fungus_oil_(mushroom)
expect 12 inv:FungusOil == 5           // no mushrooms left
